  "label": "Colonialism and Memory",
  "description": "The role of memory in preserving the history and experiences of colonized peoples, often in opposition to colonial narratives that sought to erase or distort their histories. The meme critiques the idea of forgetting colonialism by implying that such memory is essential for understanding and addressing the legacy of colonialism.",
